---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import MediaFigure from '../../components/MediaFigure.astro';
import { ASSETS } from '../../data/assets';
import { CHAPTERS, TOTALS } from '../../data/chapter-guide';

const title = 'Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy Walkthrough Guide';
const description =
  'Resonance walkthrough: all fourteen chapters from Blood Ties to What Remains, with collectible counts, Blade locations, boss fights, and patched chapter bugs.';
const crumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Walkthrough', url: '/walkthrough/' },
];
const bosses = CHAPTERS.filter((c) => c.boss);
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} pageType="collection" breadcrumbs={crumbs}>
  <div class="container py-10">
    <Breadcrumb items={crumbs} />
    <header class="mt-6 max-w-3xl">
      <p class="section-kicker">Walkthrough</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy walkthrough</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-fog">
        Fourteen chapters, two eras, one island. Open a chapter for its collectibles, Blade, boss, and any bug
        the October 6 update fixed there.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="mt-8"><MediaFigure {...ASSETS.islandOverlook} /></div>

    <div class="prose-page mt-10 max-w-3xl">
      <h2>How the campaign is structured</h2>
      <p>
        The story runs across {CHAPTERS.length} chapters. It opens in the plunderers’ camp in the Venice lagoon,
        moves through Venice and its carnival, and spends most of its length on the Minotaur’s Island, cutting
        between Sophia’s early 14th century and Theseus’s memories of the Minoan era. Steam reviewers report a
        typical Normal playthrough of about ten hours; see <a href="/how-long-to-beat/">how long to beat</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Across the chapters there are {TOTALS.blades} Blades, {TOTALS.artefacts} Artefacts, {TOTALS.charms} Charms
        and 200 Resonance Points, plus {bosses.length} boss fights. Chapter 3 is the Artefact chapter with no
        combat at all, Chapter 8 is a dream interlude with nothing to collect, and Chapter 14 is the epilogue.
        The last Blade, Xiphos, is in Chapter 10 — nothing after Parallel Paths adds to the Blade tracker.
      </p>

      <h2>What you can fix later, and what you cannot</h2>
      <p>
        Blades, Artefacts and Charms all count in Story Select after the credits, and the chapter menu shows a
        tracker for each, so none of them is permanently missable. Resonance Points are different: they save only
        at the next checkpoint, do not carry through Story Select, and cannot be farmed on a replay. You need 165
        of the 200 for every skill and mastery, so sweep dead ends on your first run. The full rules are on{' '}
        <a href="/story-select-cleanup/">Story Select cleanup</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Bosses by chapter</h2>
      <p>
        {bosses.map((c, i) => (
          <>
            {i > 0 && (i === bosses.length - 1 ? ', and ' : ', ')}
            <a href={`/walkthrough/${c.slug}/`}>{c.boss!.name} (Chapter {c.number})</a>
          </>
        ))}
        . Every duel turns on reading attack colours; the final fight is a mechanics puzzle instead. Full
        strategies: <a href="/plague-tale-legacy-all-bosses/">all bosses</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Chapter overview</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Chapter</th>
            <th scope="col">Blades</th>
            <th scope="col">Artefacts</th>
            <th scope="col">Charms</th>
            <th scope="col">Boss</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {CHAPTERS.map((ch) => (
            <tr>
              <td><a href={`/walkthrough/${ch.slug}/`}>{ch.number}. {ch.title}</a></td>
              <td>{ch.counts.blades}</td>
              <td>{ch.counts.artefacts}</td>
              <td>{ch.counts.charms}</td>
              <td>{ch.boss ? ch.boss.name : '—'}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <ol class="mt-10 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      {
        CHAPTERS.map((ch) => (
          <li class="surface overflow-hidden p-0">
            <a href={`/walkthrough/${ch.slug}/`} class="block no-underline">
              <img src={ch.image} alt={ch.imageAlt} width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-40 w-full object-cover" />
              <div class="p-5">
                <span class="text-xl font-black text-wheat">Chapter {ch.number}: {ch.title}</span>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fog">{ch.setting}</p>
              </div>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
    <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-fog">
      Maps: <a href="/maps/" class="text-wheat underline">regions of the game</a>. Collectibles:
      <a href="/plague-tale-legacy-collectibles-by-chapter/" class="text-wheat underline">counts by chapter</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
